        "stem": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One important food source for the ring-tailed lemur is the hissing cockroach, <i>Gromphadorhina</i> <i>portentosa</i>. The hissing cockroach is a large, flightless insect that lives on forest floors in Madagascar.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 16
            }
