                  "note": "No printed figure number; caption is descriptive metadata."
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Use the Lincoln index to estimate the size of this population of hissing cockroaches.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 17
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Give your answer to the nearest whole number. Show your working.",
